cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "ATLAS: summer heat, irrigation and crop yields in France"
authors:
  - family-names: Gourguechon
    given-names: Maxime
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-11"
keywords:
  - heat stress
  - irrigation
  - maize
  - France
  - panel data
  - wild cluster bootstrap
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline and research monograph on the association between summer heat and the yield gap
  between irrigated and rainfed grain maize in French departments (2000-2025), with a check of the
  empirical size of inference in panels with common weather shocks. Includes the stand-alone R module
  wcr (restricted wild cluster bootstrap and placebo size check).
